  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659758",
      "title": "Setting Default Prop Values",
      "sourceHash": "52055295a42b16b20225ec1e7778d1f43b6944998b7bc1bcd8333f894b8bfb90",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 4.02,
          "en": "Now the last concept related to components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.02,
          "end": 7.47,
          "en": "and props, I want to cover here before we move on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.47,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "to the next course project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 14.37,
          "en": "is the concept of default prop values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.37,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "And for that, we can go back to this Tabs component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 19.86,
          "en": "and there to this ButtonsContainer prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.86,
          "end": 22.74,
          "en": "which we added in the previous lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.74,
          "end": 24.54,
          "en": "Now, as you saw there, this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.54,
          "end": 28.38,
          "en": "accepts a component identifier as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.38,
          "end": 31.08,
          "en": "And whilst the idea with that prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.08,
          "end": 35.94,
          "en": "is to make that Tabs component highly reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.94,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "and configurable, chances are high that in most cases",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "we want to use a menu element as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 45.123,
          "en": "around our buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.11,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "So it would be nice if we could use this Tabs component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 52.92,
          "en": "without setting this ButtonsContainer prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.92,
          "end": 55.02,
          "en": "And in that case, the menu element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.02,
          "end": 56.703,
          "en": "should be used as a default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 59.55,
          "en": "And this can easily be achieved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.55,
          "end": 62.85,
          "en": "when using this destructuring syntax here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.85,
          "end": 67.85,
          "en": "by adding a equals sign after the prop we are destructuring.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 70.08,
          "en": "And then on the right side of the equals sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.08,
          "end": 73.68299999999999,
          "en": "we set our default value, for example, menu here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "or div, or if we would be using our custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 81.03,
          "en": "section, like this for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.03,
          "end": 84.18,
          "en": "We would have to import this section component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.18,
          "end": 86.03999999999999,
          "en": "into this file though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.03999999999999,
          "end": 88.68,
          "en": "But here it's the menu, set as a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.68,
          "end": 91.2,
          "en": "because it's a built-in element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.2,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "And by using this JavaScript feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 97.8,
          "en": "we can now use the Tabs component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "without setting the ButtonsContainer prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "And we'll still get this value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 106.32,
          "en": "this menu identifier value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 109.713,
          "en": "as a component identifier in this place here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.97,
          "end": 113.78999999999999,
          "en": "So with that, if I save everything and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.78999999999999,
          "end": 116.64,
          "en": "this app still works as it did before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.64,
          "end": 119.1,
          "en": "and we still have the menu element here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.1,
          "end": 122.88,
          "en": "being used as a wrapper because that's our default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.88,
          "end": 127.563,
          "en": "But this Tabs component is now a bit easier to use here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
